Work Item,Description / Detail
OAS Resource Management,Logic to programmatically place the OpenAPI YAML into apiproxy/resources/oas/ and link it in the proxy manifest.
API Spec Schema (api.yml),"Define a strict JSON/YAML schema for the team input file, covering name, basepath, target, and security tier."
Policy Templating Engine,"Create standardized XML sets for ""Low, Medium, High"" tiers (e.g., SpikeArrest vs. Quota vs. JSONThreatProtection)."
Intermediate Tier Policy Suite,"Develop specific XMLs for Barclays' Intermediate Tier, including JWKS URI validation and KVM-based secret lookups."
WSDL-to-OAS Converter,Integration of a utility to automatically transform legacy SOAP WSDLs into OpenAPI 3.0 specs for the onboarding package.
BAP Target Selection Logic,"Logic within the build script to prioritize ""bap"" hostnames from the Akana export for backend routing."
Standardized Fault Handling,Design universal FaultRules templates to ensure consistent error response formats across all bank APIs.
Shared Flow Integration,"Identify global logic (logging, header stripping) to be called via SharedFlowBundle across all generated proxies."
Validation Hook,A pre-build script to detect basepath collisions or missing metadata before the proxy bundle is generated.
XSD Compliance Engine,Ensures generated XMLs (like XMLToJSON) follow Apigee's strict schema to prevent deployment-time failures.
